<title>UK: BASKETBALL-EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of men's EuroLeague</p>
<p>basketball championship matches on Thursday:</p>
<p>In Leverkusen: Bayer Leverkusen (Germany) 60 Croatia Split</p>
<p>63 (halftime 33-28)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Bayer Leverkusen - Tony Dawson 22, Kevin Pritchard 12</p>
<p>Croatia - Damir Tvrdic 19, Ante Grgurevic 14</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,500.</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>In Zagreb:</p>
<p>Cibona Zagreb (Croatia) 78 Alba Berlin (Germany) 68 (46-31)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Cibona - Damir Mulaomerovic 28, Slaven Rimac 12, Zdravko</p>
<p>Radulovic 11</p>
<p>Alba Berlin - Sasa Obradovic 17, Hening Harnisch 14, Wendell</p>
<p>Alexis 11</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,500</p>
<p>Group D</p>
<p>Bologna: Bologna (Italy) 93 Sevilla (Spain) 75 (53-40)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Bologna - Savic 24, Komazec 23, Prelevic 20</p>
<p>Sevilla - Anderson 18, Doblado 14, Carney 9</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,500</p>
<p>Group A </p>
<p>In Tel Aviv: Maccabi Tel Aviv (Israel) 78 Stefanel Milan</p>
<p>(Italy) 68 (39-36)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Maccabi Tel Aviv - Buck Johnson 19, Randy White 16</p>
