<p>Group B </p>
<p>In Madrid: Estudiantes Madrid (Spain) 66 Teamsystem Bologna</p>
<p>(Italy) 75 (29-31)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Estudiantes - Harper Williams 36, Ignacio de Miguel 8</p>
<p>Bologna - Carlton Myers 21, John Crotty 16, Francesco</p>
<p>Vescovi 13 Conrad McRae 13</p>
<p>In Charleroi:</p>
<p>Charleroi (Belgium) 72 Olympiakos (Greece) 79 (33-31)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Charleroi - Ron Ellis 15, Adam Woycik 13, Eric Cleymans 12</p>
<p>Olympiakos - David Rivers 23, Welp 13, Tarlac 12</p>
